# Site Info
title: "Alex Snow"
tagline: "AI & LLM Consulting · German SMBs & Cultural Institutions"
description: 'Practical AI, LLM, and Agentic Systems consulting for small and medium-sized businesses and cultural institutions (museums, galleries) in Germany. Knowledge sharing and insights from 13+ years of hands-on learning. By <a href="https://github.com/alexsnowschool" target="_blank">Alex Snow</a>.'
